# Solar ERP Platform (C&I & Utility Scale) — Implementation Walkthrough

The full-stack Solar ERP & Field Operations Platform has been built with clean, modular, production-ready code with no cluttered or redundant comments.

---

## 1. Architecture & Tech Stack

- **Backend**: Node.js & Express REST API on `http://localhost:5000` with JWT authentication, role-based access control (`SUPER_ADMIN`, `SURVEY_ENGINEER`, `DESIGN_ENGINEER`, `SALES_MANAGER`), and PostgreSQL DDL schema with 8 connected tables.
- **Frontend**: React (Vite) on `http://localhost:3000`, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React, Leaflet.js (OpenStreetMap & ESRI World Imagery), HTML5 DeviceOrientation API, and jsPDF / AutoTable.
- **Theme**: Dark enterprise Glassmorphism (Slate-950 background with Cyan-400 and Emerald-400 neon accents).

---

## 2. Complete Module Implementation Details

### Module A: Mobile PWA Field Survey & Photogrammetry
- **Interactive Satellite Map**: Toggleable ESRI World Imagery and OpenStreetMap tile layers.
- **GPS Coordinates Locking**: Pin site coordinates with real-time latitude, longitude, and site address locking.
- **Roof Polygon Area Measurement**: Multi-vertex polygon drawing tool on map with real-time **Shoelace formula** calculating usable area in sq ft and $\text{m}^2$.
- **Photogrammetric Gyroscope Tool**: Connects to HTML5 `DeviceOrientationEvent` with dynamic Roof Pitch ($0^\circ–90^\circ$) and Azimuth compass ($0^\circ–360^\circ$) indicators and fallback desktop sliders.
- **Categorized Media Upload Dropzone**: 6 categories with real-time previews: `Roof Surface`, `Electrical Panel`, `Cable Route`, `Inverter Location`, `Transformer`, and `Obstructions`.

### Module B: CAD Design & MPPT Solar Stringing Matcher
- **PV Module Specifications**: Support for 550W, 585W, 650W, and 700W N-Type TOPCon bifacial modules.
- **Temperature-Corrected String Validation**:
  - Winter $V_{oc}$ at $-5^\circ\text{C}$ ($V_{oc} \times [1 + \gamma_{voc} \times (-5 - 25)] \times N$)
  - Summer $V_{mp}$ at $+55^\circ\text{C}$ ($V_{mp} \times [1 + \gamma_{vmp} \times (55 - 25)] \times N$)
  - Temperature coefficient: $-0.28\%/^\circ\text{C}$
- **Visual Safe-Zone Gauge Indicator**: Inverter MPPT range ($500\text{V}–1000\text{V}$) and maximum PV limit ($1100\text{V}$).
- **Auto-Optimize Stringing**: Automatically discovers optimal stringing sizes.

### Module C: Dynamic L1 / L2 / L3 Multi-Scale BOQ Engine
- **Capacity Scaling**: Dynamic calculations from residential setups (5kW–25kW) to multi-megawatt farms (1MW–50MW+).
- **Multi-Tier Views**:
  - **L1 (Executive Summary)**: High-level cost heads ($/W or $/kW rates).
  - **L2 (Component Level)**: Module count, Inverter specs, HDG structure, DC/AC cable lengths, MCCB/SPDs.
  - **L3 (Granular Industrial EPC)**: SS304 mid/end clamps, perforated GI cable trays, chemical earthing rods ($< 1\,\Omega$), C25/30 reinforced concrete plinths ($\text{m}^3$), and SCADA weather stations.

### Module D: Enterprise Financial ROI & ESG Metrics
- **25-Year Life Cycle**: 0.5% annual degradation, 3.5% grid tariff escalation, and 1.2% OPEX maintenance.
- **NPV**: Net Present Value calculated over 25 years at a 9.0% discount rate.
- **IRR & LCOE**: Internal Rate of Return and Levelized Cost of Energy compared against grid utility tariffs ($0.160/kWh).
- **Payback Period**: Accurate payback displayed in years and months.
- **ESG Carbon Offset**: Annual and 25-year $\text{CO}_2$ avoidance with equivalent trees planted.
- **Interactive 25-Year Cash Flow Visualization**: Visual break-even and cumulative cash flow chart.

### Module E: Triple Super Admin Locking & PDF Proposals
- **Proposal Edit Lock**: When engaged by a Super Admin (`is_locked = true`), capacity, quantities, and pricing are cryptographically locked against unauthorized modifications.
- **Immutable Audit Trail**: Tracks User ID, role, action, IP address, timestamp, and JSON diffs.
- **Branded PDF Export**: Exports styled, client-ready proposals with company header, executive summary, CAD stringing table, BOQ breakdown, and 25-year financial metrics.

